cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Angular Factors Calculator: angle-resolved annihilation-photon correlation factors"
version: 0.1.0-dev
authors:
  - family-names: Priyadarshi
    given-names: Ayush
abstract: >-
  A Python package for fitting angle-resolved total-interaction and effective
  full-energy response coefficients from Geant4 ROOT events and calculating
  annihilation-photon angular-correlation factors for centered annular
  detectors.
keywords:
  - angular correlation
  - annihilation photons
  - coincidence summing
  - Geant4
  - NaI detector
license: BSD-3-Clause
